%% ① 上传 → beat 检测/分段 → 前端轮询 → 教学页
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant UP as UploadPage
    participant C as ApiClient
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant TM as TaskManager
    participant AE as AudioExtractor
    participant BD as BeatDetector
    participant SG as Segmenter
    participant AP as AnalysisPage
    participant LP as LessonPage

    U->>UP: 选择视频 / 粘贴链接
    UP->>C: upload(file/url)
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/upload
    API->>TM: create_task()
    TM-->>API: {taskId, status:queued}
    API-->>C: {taskId}
    C-->>UP: 跳转 AnalysisPage(taskId)

    TM->>AE: extract(video) [后台异步]
    AE-->>TM: wav_path (status=extracting)
    TM->>BD: detect(wav) (status=beat_detecting)
    BD-->>TM: bpm, confidence, beat_times
    TM->>SG: aggregate(beat_times) (status=segmenting)
    SG-->>TM: segments[]
    TM-->>TM: result = AnalysisResult (status=done)

    AP->>C: poll(taskId) [每 ~1s]
    C->>API: GET /api/v1/analysis/{taskId}
    API-->>C: {status, progress, result?}
    C-->>AP: 渲染四步进度
    Note over AP: status=done 自动跳转
    AP->>LP: 进入 LessonPage(taskId)
    LP->>C: getResult(taskId)
    C->>API: GET /api/v1/analysis/{taskId}/result
    API-->>C: AnalysisResult
    C-->>LP: 渲染 SegmentList / VideoPlayer / BeatOverlay

%% ② 播放时 currentTime 驱动节拍叠加（运行时，rAF 驱动）
sequenceDiagram
    participant V as VideoPlayer(video)
    participant H as useBeatSync(rAF)
    participant S as LessonStore
    participant O as BeatOverlay
    participant U as 用户

    U->>V: 播放 / 点击小节
    V->>S: setSegment(i) / play
    loop 每帧 requestAnimationFrame
        H->>V: currentTime (cur)
        H->>H: segment = find(start<=cur<end)
        H->>H: beatIdx = count(beats<=cur)
        H->>O: 渲染 beatIdx (1..8)
        loop 每个 beatT in segment.beats
            alt prev < beatT <= cur
                H->>O: pulse(beatIdx)
            end
        end
        alt loopSegment && cur >= segment.endTime
            H->>V: currentTime = segment.startTime
        end
        H->>H: prev = cur
    end
    Note over H,O: 慢放(playbackRate) 不改变拍点时间戳，脉冲随慢放变慢
